Value INTERFACE (\S+\s+\d+\/\d+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value VLAN (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Vlan\s+Duplex\s+Speed\s+Type\s*$$ -> Continue
  ^[-\s]+\s*$$ -> Continue
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record